ck, cert digests, schemes present\", \"priority\": 2, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"D21 flavor 'distinguish rebuilds from clones' = same package, different SIGNER (clone/repack) vs same si\n416:  {\"id\": \"macos-xar-pkg-dmg\", \"concept\": \"macOS installer containers: xar `.pkg`, flat-package TOC, DMG koly trailer\", \"priority\": 2, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"fmt pkg (aliases xar, macos_pkg): header `xar!` (78 61 72 21) BE: header_size u16 @4, version u16 @6, toc_length_compressed u64 @\n452:  {\"id\": \"pe-authenticode\", \"concept\": \"PE Authenticode signer / cert serial / thumbprint / signing time\", \"priority\": 2, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"fmt pe, fields is_signed, security_dir_size_u32_hex, signer_subject_cn, signer_issuer_cn, signer_serial_hex, signer_cert_sha1, signer_cert_sh\n465:  {\"id\": \"x509-cert\", \"concept\": \"X.509 subject/issuer/serial/validity/fingerprint\", \"priority\": 2, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"fmt x509 (alias cert), fields subject_cn, issuer_cn, serial_hex, not_before_utc, not_after_utc, sha256_fingerprint, sha1_fingerprint, san_dns_names. Shares the DER\n502:  {\"id\": \"mobileprovision-entitlements\", \"concept\": \"Standalone `.mobileprovision` / entitlements plists / iOS app extension Info.plists\", \"priority\": 3, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"fmt mobileprovision (alias provisioning_profile): CMS DER with an embedded XML plist (find `<?xml`..`</plist>\n511:  {\"id\": \"tls-certs-in-capture\", \"concept\": \"Certificates and TLS fingerprints carried inside captures; SSLKEYLOGFILE\", \"priority\": 3, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"From pcap-app-indicators TLS reassembly (TCP segments of one stream in seq order): Certificate handshake (type 11, TLS<=1.2) ->","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"14bad9c5-435c-4bf1-a0e5-585e1c154e51","uuid":"64a7bbc3-dfe1-48ad-9fea-814733112c4f","timestamp":"2026-10-29T13:04:38.028Z","tool_use_result":{"std